{"id":"hie2prn4rkrpsem4egj9fibgn","title":"Euclid 发布首份数据集：迈向其天空三维地图的重要一步","originalTitle":"Euclid's first data release: A stepping stone to its 3D map of the sky","summary":"Euclid 发布了其首份数据集 DR1-Foundation，覆盖约 9,500 个满月大小的天空区域，包含超过 10 亿个天体。该数据集来自为期一年的观测，将用于研究暗能量和暗物质。Wide 和 Deep 两个调查将共同构建 Euclid 的三维地图，其中 Wide 调查覆盖大范围区域，而 Deep 调查则聚焦更小、更暗淡的天体。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-euclid-stone-3d-sky.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T13:00:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T14:11:33.591Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T14:11:33.591Z","category":"materials-energy","tags":["研究成果"],"score":46,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"0d229bbd-c35e-4f97-b3da-abe83171ce52","title":"Euclid发布首份数据集DR1-Foundation"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"0d229bbd-c35e-4f97-b3da-abe83171ce52","title":"Euclid发布首份数据集DR1-Foundation"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f894PlLaGtKs","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}